xt":"Itsuki Midoriba is Rin's \"bad\" friend and classmate. Being the womanizer of the class, he is envious of the girls' attraction to Rin and often mentions that he will look after the girls Rin does not pick."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4685"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09a06244c6253cf5ec3d971b639bc09bb7409e33f5cf14019a899f2f179188f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/969c0671e8a88b2ff31cbd16337699e654a739c8519f513e5aa1214f8ee441ff.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小池 竹蔵","creatorId":"vndb:s749","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s749","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s749","name":"荻原 秀樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:2154","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4687","characterName":"時雨 亜麻","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4687"},"originalCharacterName":"時雨 亜麻","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"603"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ama Shigure is Asa's mother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has the habit of drastically reducing names to cute nicknames (Asa for instance is referred to as \"A-chan\"). She also wears a cat-ear hat. She looks abnormally young to be a mother, and it surprises the other characters to learn that she is quite a bit older than she looks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4687"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e469c24b94f2b5531380ac2233cb4e29c0a4d4925017d6f9b746c71bb3f40c1d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c39f7a7976835a4d8d7ef253e0dbe91a1bc1199cd40c905947ab64d802c7936f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"有里亜","creatorId":"vndb:s983","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s983","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s983","name":"有里亜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:2156","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4688","characterName":"セージ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4688"},"originalCharacterName":"セージ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1218"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"75"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sage is Forbesii's maid. In the standard timeline, she marries him and is Nerine's mother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sage is very energetic and cheerful in almost all circumstances. She is an excellent housemaker and good at hiding her feeling, especially towards Forbesii, to whom her whole heart is dedicated. However, since Forbesii is a prince and she is just his maid, Sage tries to provide services to Forbesii and devotes her life to it in the hope that she may not have to leave him when he ties the knot with his fiancee, Ai."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In one possible timeline, Rin may decide to engage in sexual and romantic relations with Sage, thus changing the future mother of Nerine. Rin will be forced to reject Sage when she asks him who he would choose as a partner - Nerine or Sage. Sage will then admit she will later cry over the fact Rin is leaving her behind. A red-haired Nerine will replace the original blue-haired one if Rin chooses this path."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4688"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/5692a89d2baaacbc5fa478046b845661e34c87623108ddb79ff56d56fdc26842.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23a5f95fb5a867eded42df09f368ce3f00f7dda76d2358ad830f77995861d37b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青山 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:2147","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4692","characterName":"八重 桜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4692"},"originalCharacterName":"八重 桜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"509"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb"